WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:14.476
"Peter!" Benjamin called.

2
00:00:14.477 --> 00:00:17.641
"Let's fly my kite today."

3
00:00:17.642 --> 00:00:22.859
Peter shook his head.

4
00:00:22.860 --> 00:00:25.463
"It's Laundry Day.

5
00:00:25.464 --> 00:00:28.181
I have a bag of dirty clothes.

6
00:00:28.182 --> 00:00:33.054
Mrs. Tiggywinkle is going to wash them."

7
00:00:33.055 --> 00:00:36.525
"I will help you with the bag," Benjamin said.

8
00:00:36.526 --> 00:00:38.747
"Then we can play."

9
00:00:38.748 --> 00:00:51.504
Peter grinned. "Let's go!"

10
00:00:51.505 --> 00:00:55.550
The bunnies pulled the bag along the road.

11
00:00:55.551 --> 00:01:06.150
They dragged it up a hill.

12
00:01:06.151 --> 00:01:08.688
They dropped it in a puddle.

13
00:01:08.689 --> 00:01:11.114
"Oops," Peter said.

14
00:01:11.115 --> 00:01:20.109
"Now the laundry is really dirty!"

15
00:01:20.110 --> 00:01:27.861
The bunnies got to Mrs. Tiggywinkle's house.

16
00:01:27.862 --> 00:01:30.926
"Wow," Peter said.

17
00:01:30.927 --> 00:01:36.895
"This is a lot of laundry!" Benjamin said.

18
00:01:36.896 --> 00:01:42.042
Mrs. Tiggywinkle was very tired.

19
00:01:42.043 --> 00:01:45.772
She looked at Peter's bag.

20
00:01:45.773 --> 00:01:47.945
"Ugh," she said.

21
00:01:47.946 --> 00:01:50.828
"These clothes are a mess!"

22
00:01:50.829 --> 00:01:53.735
"Sorry," Peter said.

23
00:01:53.736 --> 00:01:58.186
"The clothes were already dirty," Benjamin said.

24
00:01:58.187 --> 00:02:00.870
Mrs. Tiggywinkle frowned.

25
00:02:00.871 --> 00:02:04.253
"Careless bunnies!" she said.

26
00:02:04.254 --> 00:02:07.838
Mrs. Tiggywinkle took off her apron.

27
00:02:07.839 --> 00:02:12.065
"I am too tired to work today," she said.

28
00:02:12.066 --> 00:02:14.366
"I need a holiday!"

29
00:02:14.367 --> 00:02:23.673
Then she dashed out the door.

